WEBVTT

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:03.184
After laissez-faire economics
triggered the Great Depression,

00:04:03.208 --> 00:04:08.643
John Maynard Keynes
sat down to write a new economics,

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:12.559
and what he did was to tell
a restoration story,

00:04:12.583 --> 00:04:14.250
and it went something like this.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.184
Disorder afflicts the land!

00:04:18.208 --> 00:04:19.476
(Laughter)

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:24.184
Caused by the powerful and nefarious
forces of the economic elite,

00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:27.125
which have captured the world's wealth.

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:30.184
But the hero of the story,